# Solver sidecars use the Tauri target-triple naming convention:
# - Windows: solver-service-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.exe
# - macOS Apple Silicon: solver-service-aarch64-apple-darwin
# - macOS Intel: solver-service-x86_64-apple-darwin
# - Linux: solver-service-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu
#
# Production releases publish the solver separately; Orbis downloads it when
# timetable solving is first used. Staging builds bundle the generated sidecar:
# mvn package -Dnative -DskipTests (in apps/solver-service)
